msgid ""
"⚠ Web font in use (%(fonts)s): every admin user's browser downloads it from "
"%(hosts)s, a third-party server. For a fully self-hosted admin, download the"
" font and upload the files under Fonts."
msgstr ""
"⚠ Webfont in Verwendung (%(fonts)s): Der Browser jedes Admin-Benutzers lädt "
